Z||000002||Cozmo||12-05-2001||08:34 AM||||Should be a direct swap over although if they are different (auto vs. manual transmission) you may need to mix and match parts. <BR>Not a tough job, just unplug all the wires and take off all the big bolts... then pull it out. You don't even have to remove the steering wheel.  I hope you have the ignition key for the new column or it will get more complicated... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>Good Luck!<P>BobC||||reg||1
